"them, and calls `rank_population()` — folding the paper's initial fitness"
" assignment and first environmental selection into initialization — then "
"hands the top `n_init_population` to the initial population)"
msgstr ""
"`LHSInitializer`（`n_init_archive`個体をサンプルし真の評価を行い、`rank_population()`を呼ぶ——原論文の初期fitness"
" assignmentと最初のenvironmental "
"selectionを初期化に畳み込んでいる——その後上位`n_init_population`個体を初期populationへ渡す）"

